
# Source GIFs for the card slot — NEVER commit these. Eleven of them came to
# 570MB; the mp4s built from them come to 8.9MB and look better (a GIF is
# capped at 256 colours). Git keeps whatever it is given forever, so one
# `git add .` on a folder of these would weigh the repo down permanently, and
# GitHub refuses a file over 100MB anyway. Convert, commit studio/assets/cards/.
studio/assets/*.gif
.DS_Store
